  python  tiktoken.Encoding.encode_with_unstable
  note    -

capability tok/chat  the tokens of a chat request counted, and what is left of a model's window
  heroes  refused: the tokens that frame a chat's messages are OpenAI's to count, and its API answers them in each response's `usage` (`llm/openai`); the rule tiktoken-rs follows is an estimate from OpenAI's cookbook, and a model's window is a fact of the model, not of its encoding
  go      -
  rust    num_tokens_from_messages, get_chat_completion_max_tokens, get_text_completion_max_tokens, get_completion_max_tokens, model::get_context_size, ChatCompletionRequestMessage, FunctionCall
  python  -
  note    -

capability tok/hf-json  a tokenizer of Hugging Face read from its `tokenizer.json`, and written
  heroes  pending
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  tokenizers.Tokenizer.from_file, tokenizers.Tokenizer.from_str, tokenizers.Tokenizer.from_buffer, tokenizers.Tokenizer.save, tokenizers.Tokenizer.to_str
